    //     mediaSrc: "A LINK TO AN IMAGE YOU HAVE ON THE WEBSITE.. E.G. - /images/whatever.ext",
    //     mediaAlt: "TEXT THAT APPEARS WHEN YOU HOVER OVER THE IMAGE - FOR ACCESSIBILITY PURPOSES.",
    //     content: "The text that appears next to image. Keep it concise for now, just until i can format the container to look prettier.
    //               currently doesn't allow for any formatting, and NEEDS TO BE KEPT ON ONE LINE IN THIS FORMAT. Will fix this later. Promise"
    // },
    {
        title: "look at her",
        mediaSrc: "/images/nessie.jpeg",
        mediaAlt: "beautiful dog",
        content:
            "Would you just look at her...  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec et est dictum, vestibulum nulla eu, tincidunt eros. Etiam malesuada quam metus, eget placerat nisl euismod at. Proin sed ligula pellentesque, tincidunt nibh in, facilisis nibh. Cras pellentesque malesuada orci, ac dictum magna hendrerit quis. Integer lectus odio, vehicula in pellentesque in, finibus a erat. Sed sit amet efficitur ipsum, id varius arcu. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Proin ultricies dolor sed erat pellentesque dictum. Suspendisse feugiat laoreet elit, sit amet dignissim nulla cursus id. Morbi commodo varius nibh eget sagittis.",
